1
00:00:55,119 --> 00:00:55,759
Li Wen

2
00:00:55,759 --> 00:00:56,479
Brother Liu

3
00:00:56,880 --> 00:00:57,840
What are you doing here?

4
00:00:58,119 --> 00:00:59,920
I saw Bro Snake's desk was a mess,

5
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:01,039
so I was tidying it up.

6
00:01:01,320 --> 00:01:02,479
You're hiding something.

7
00:01:05,680 --> 00:01:07,519
Hiding things, huh?

8
00:01:16,719 --> 00:01:18,599
You've got sticky fingers, boy.

9
00:01:18,680 --> 00:01:19,239
Move.

10
00:01:20,280 --> 00:01:21,000
Brother Liu!

11
00:01:21,519 --> 00:01:23,719
I just wanted to make a little extra cash!

12
00:01:24,519 --> 00:01:26,120
Let go of me first.

13
00:01:28,840 --> 00:01:29,560
I don't know why,

14
00:01:29,560 --> 00:01:31,159
but Bro Snake won't let me in on this deal.

15
00:01:31,719 --> 00:01:32,840
I'm just getting desperate!

16
00:01:34,079 --> 00:01:34,840
Won't let you in?

17
00:01:35,599 --> 00:01:37,200
I haven't made much on recent deals.

18
00:01:37,439 --> 00:01:38,400
I'm worried to death.

19
00:01:39,920 --> 00:01:42,000
But what can we do if Bro Snake made the call?

20
00:01:44,439 --> 00:01:45,359
How about...

21
00:01:45,680 --> 00:01:46,319
we do this.

22
00:01:46,680 --> 00:01:47,239
Brother Liu,

23
00:01:47,239 --> 00:01:49,439
put in a good word for me,

24
00:01:50,120 --> 00:01:50,920
and let me in on it.

25
00:01:51,640 --> 00:01:53,560
I'll leave a backdoor in the code for you.

26
00:01:53,560 --> 00:01:54,599
I'll let you make some extra cash.

27
00:01:57,200 --> 00:01:57,719
Seriously?

28
00:01:58,000 --> 00:01:59,319
Why wouldn't it be reliable?

29
00:01:59,680 --> 00:02:01,000
Nobody else will ever know.

30
00:02:01,719 --> 00:02:02,400
And also,

31
00:02:02,959 --> 00:02:03,920
just now,

32
00:02:04,040 --> 00:02:05,280
he stood in front of all those people

33
00:02:05,280 --> 00:02:06,239
and humiliated you.

34
00:02:06,560 --> 00:02:07,920
Wasn't he paving the way for this deal?

35
00:02:09,599 --> 00:02:11,080
Grass Snake is nothing but a loser.

36
00:02:11,319 --> 00:02:12,759
High-tech industry? What does he know?

37
00:02:12,960 --> 00:02:14,120
Exactly.

38
00:02:14,319 --> 00:02:15,560
I'll take him down sooner or later.

39
00:02:17,080 --> 00:02:19,319
From now on, I only follow Brother Liu.

40
00:02:21,680 --> 00:02:22,840
You've got a good eye, kid.

41
00:02:23,719 --> 00:02:24,680
Done deal.

42
00:02:25,080 --> 00:02:27,159
You'll get a cut of this deal.

43
00:02:28,319 --> 00:02:29,039
Really?

44
00:02:29,360 --> 00:02:30,400
Thank you, Brother Liu.

45
00:02:32,680 --> 00:02:33,479
Forget it.

46
00:02:34,120 --> 00:02:35,240
Just don't let anyone see you.

47
00:02:35,400 --> 00:02:36,560
Don't worry, don't worry.

48
00:02:46,680 --> 00:02:47,479
Bro Snake

49
00:02:48,879 --> 00:02:50,280
I was just looking for you.

50
00:02:50,719 --> 00:02:51,919
I brought you some fresh tea.

51
00:02:52,479 --> 00:02:53,280
Pre-Qingming Longjing.

52
00:02:54,199 --> 00:02:55,000
It cuts the grease and relieves fatigue.

53
00:02:57,439 --> 00:02:59,319
You sure know how to pick a time.

54
00:02:59,919 --> 00:03:01,919
I've been eating too much meat lately.

55
00:03:03,599 --> 00:03:04,400
How thoughtful.

56
00:03:06,000 --> 00:03:06,800
Bro Snake.

57
00:03:09,520 --> 00:03:10,240
Bro Snake.

58
00:03:11,280 --> 00:03:14,080
Can I help out with your new deal?

59
00:03:14,680 --> 00:03:16,800
This involves over a hundred seniors.

60
00:03:18,719 --> 00:03:20,080
You sure you have the stomach for it?

61
00:03:20,400 --> 00:03:22,879
His target this time is the nursing home.

62
00:03:24,599 --> 00:03:25,840
I'm practically starving to death myself.

63
00:03:25,919 --> 00:03:27,319
Why would I care if others live or die?

64
00:03:27,719 --> 00:03:28,520
Alright.

65
00:03:28,800 --> 00:03:30,039
I'll let you in on this job.

66
00:03:30,439 --> 00:03:31,319
Really, Bro Snake?

67
00:03:32,680 --> 00:03:35,120
Here, Bro Snake, have some tea.

68
00:03:39,319 --> 00:03:41,919
If anything goes wrong again this time...

69
00:03:42,599 --> 00:03:44,520
...Lao Liu won't have to step in.

70
00:03:45,639 --> 00:03:46,879
I'll do it myself.

71
00:03:47,560 --> 00:03:48,360
Understood.

72
00:03:51,240 --> 00:03:52,599
Good that you understand.

73
00:04:07,719 --> 00:04:08,520
Here, please.

74
00:04:09,039 --> 00:04:10,719
You're too polite, Director Qin.

75
00:04:11,240 --> 00:04:12,560
I should have come sooner.

76
00:04:13,199 --> 00:04:15,159
You are my lifesaver.

77
00:04:16,040 --> 00:04:16,800
Lifesaver?

78
00:04:17,759 --> 00:04:18,519
Yes.

79
00:04:18,519 --> 00:04:20,720
Why do you say that?

80
00:04:21,160 --> 00:04:22,720
Cao Sheng from your nursing home...

81
00:04:22,800 --> 00:04:23,600
...is my third uncle.

82
00:04:23,600 --> 00:04:25,399
He stayed here a year ago.

83
00:04:26,800 --> 00:04:27,680
As for me,

84
00:04:27,680 --> 00:04:28,839
I was orphaned at a young age.

85
00:04:29,600 --> 00:04:32,199
My third uncle worked so hard to raise me.

86
00:04:32,720 --> 00:04:35,319
Later, I left to make my way in the world.

87
00:04:36,199 --> 00:04:37,600
By the time I came back,

88
00:04:39,519 --> 00:04:40,920
my third uncle had already passed away.

89
00:04:41,680 --> 00:04:43,079
So that's what happened.

90
00:04:43,759 --> 00:04:46,000
I didn't even get to take care of him.

91
00:04:46,759 --> 00:04:48,600
Tell me, why make all this money...

92
00:04:49,480 --> 00:04:50,560
...anyway?

93
00:04:51,160 --> 00:04:52,720
I'm such a bastard.

94
00:04:53,519 --> 00:04:54,959
Mr. Cao.

95
00:04:55,519 --> 00:04:57,439
My condolences. Please, stay strong.

96
00:04:58,000 --> 00:04:58,839
Director Qin.

97
00:04:58,839 --> 00:05:00,040
I know that you...

98
00:05:00,040 --> 00:05:02,360
...never accept monetary donations.

99
00:05:02,680 --> 00:05:04,600
I heard a while ago...

100
00:05:05,199 --> 00:05:06,920
...that the nursing home is expanding.

101
00:05:07,040 --> 00:05:08,959
I was so thrilled when I heard that.

102
00:05:09,199 --> 00:05:11,160
I really hope that through a donation,

103
00:05:11,160 --> 00:05:14,920
I can help improve the seniors' housing.

104
00:05:15,160 --> 00:05:16,959
That is a large sum of money.

105
00:05:17,439 --> 00:05:18,560
You business people...

106
00:05:18,560 --> 00:05:19,439
...don't have it easy either.

107
00:05:19,439 --> 00:05:20,279
Director Qin.

108
00:05:20,279 --> 00:05:21,519
No, Uncle.

109
00:05:22,079 --> 00:05:23,800
You're like my own uncle.

110
00:05:24,199 --> 00:05:25,639
Please give this junior...

111
00:05:25,800 --> 00:05:28,040
...a chance to contribute to the elderly.

112
00:05:28,360 --> 00:05:29,399
I'm begging you.

113
00:05:29,399 --> 00:05:33,519
They say to share the wealth you earn.

114
00:05:33,839 --> 00:05:35,399
It brings good karma.

115
00:05:35,439 --> 00:05:36,920
If you don't agree,

116
00:05:37,040 --> 00:05:38,319
I won't leave here today.

117
00:05:38,680 --> 00:05:39,680
Please.

118
00:05:40,519 --> 00:05:41,199
Well...

119
00:05:44,360 --> 00:05:45,160
All right then.

120
00:05:45,839 --> 00:05:47,040
Then on behalf of...

121
00:05:47,040 --> 00:05:48,439
...all the elderly residents,

122
00:05:48,800 --> 00:05:51,319
I thank you for your donation, Mr. Cao.

123
00:05:52,079 --> 00:05:52,720
Thank you, Uncle.

124
00:05:52,720 --> 00:05:53,560
Thank you, Uncle.

125
00:05:55,000 --> 00:05:57,439
Let me show you our expansion project.

126
00:05:59,720 --> 00:06:01,839
This is our planned expansion project.

127
00:06:03,800 --> 00:06:05,439
I took a brief look.

128
00:06:05,439 --> 00:06:07,439
The total budget for the whole project...

129
00:06:07,439 --> 00:06:08,639
...is around eight million.

130
00:06:08,959 --> 00:06:10,040
Personally,

131
00:06:10,040 --> 00:06:10,879
I'll provide four million.

132
00:06:11,040 --> 00:06:13,399
The nursing home will cover the rest.

133
00:06:13,839 --> 00:06:14,879
Is that okay, Uncle?

134
00:06:14,879 --> 00:06:15,920
Originally,

135
00:06:15,920 --> 00:06:18,839
I only planned to spend four million.

136
00:06:18,920 --> 00:06:20,360
Of course, with your donation,

137
00:06:20,360 --> 00:06:22,439
we can build a much better facility.

138
00:06:22,439 --> 00:06:23,639
I have no problem with it, of course.

139
00:06:23,839 --> 00:06:24,639
Great, Uncle.

140
00:06:24,639 --> 00:06:26,639
Then let's sign the contract.

141
00:06:27,040 --> 00:06:27,800
As for me,

142
00:06:27,800 --> 00:06:30,639
I'll wire the funds to the project account.

143
00:06:30,759 --> 00:06:33,319
You can wire your share after checking.

144
00:06:33,319 --> 00:06:35,040
You see, this account...

145
00:06:35,519 --> 00:06:37,040
...will be jointly managed by both of us.

146
00:06:37,600 --> 00:06:38,560
Does that sound good, Uncle?

147
00:06:38,560 --> 00:06:39,439
Is that okay?

148
00:06:39,439 --> 00:06:40,199
That's fine.

149
00:06:41,160 --> 00:06:41,959
Xiao Li,

150
00:06:42,319 --> 00:06:43,240
bring the documents over.

151
00:06:43,240 --> 00:06:44,160
Yes, sir.

152
00:06:51,639 --> 00:06:53,480
Here, Uncle, take a look.

153
00:07:03,720 --> 00:07:04,439
Alright.

154
00:07:04,439 --> 00:07:05,680
Mr. Cao,

155
00:07:06,040 --> 00:07:08,839
when is a good time to visit your company?

156
00:07:09,000 --> 00:07:09,959
Right now is fine.

157
00:07:09,959 --> 00:07:10,959
The car is right downstairs.

158
00:07:11,319 --> 00:07:13,279
Alright, should we go now?

159
00:07:13,279 --> 00:07:13,920
Let's go, Uncle.

160
00:07:13,920 --> 00:07:14,360
Alright.

161
00:07:24,560 --> 00:07:25,839
Keep quiet.

162
00:07:32,560 --> 00:07:33,920
This sucks.

163
00:07:36,399 --> 00:07:38,319
These are the students Mr. Cao sponsored.

164
00:07:38,319 --> 00:07:39,399
Here's a group photo taken with them.

165
00:07:39,720 --> 00:07:41,439
And this is what Mr. Cao received:

166
00:07:41,439 --> 00:07:43,759
the Outstanding Entrepreneur trophy,

167
00:07:43,839 --> 00:07:44,639
along with the certificate.

168
00:07:45,000 --> 00:07:48,399
Mr. Cao's charitable deeds are commendable.

169
00:07:48,759 --> 00:07:49,920
We should all learn from him.

170
00:07:50,519 --> 00:07:53,160
You can never make enough money.

171
00:07:53,959 --> 00:07:54,879
Having enough is what matters.

172
00:07:56,759 --> 00:07:57,839
Xiao Li,

173
00:07:57,839 --> 00:08:00,959
helping the elderly enjoy their retirement

174
00:08:01,360 --> 00:08:02,360
is also a great cause.

175
00:08:03,040 --> 00:08:04,240
Transfer the money over now.

176
00:08:04,839 --> 00:08:05,480
Yes, sir.

177
00:08:06,000 --> 00:08:07,240
Mr. Cao,

178
00:08:07,680 --> 00:08:10,240
on behalf of those helpless elderly,

179
00:08:10,240 --> 00:08:11,160
I really must thank you.

180
00:08:11,519 --> 00:08:14,079
Don't mention it. It's all for charity.

181
00:08:14,639 --> 00:08:16,199
Come, have some tea.

182
00:08:27,839 --> 00:08:28,480
It's transferred.

183
00:08:34,559 --> 00:08:35,759
Thank you, Mr. Cao.

184
00:08:35,759 --> 00:08:36,440
Thank you so much.

185
00:08:43,960 --> 00:08:46,399
Let's tie Grass Snake up at the next turn.

186
00:08:47,200 --> 00:08:48,000
Li Wen.

187
00:08:49,200 --> 00:08:50,399
You did well today.

188
00:08:50,799 --> 00:08:52,000
Without you setting the stage,

189
00:08:52,679 --> 00:08:53,720
we couldn't have put on this show.

190
00:08:54,159 --> 00:08:54,960
Bro Snake.

191
00:08:55,519 --> 00:08:56,399
All the credit goes to you.

192
00:08:56,399 --> 00:08:57,600
I'm just an errand boy at best.

193
00:08:58,480 --> 00:08:59,279
Not bad.

194
00:09:00,120 --> 00:09:01,720
You still haven't run away.

195
00:09:04,080 --> 00:09:04,879
Bro Snake.

196
00:09:06,000 --> 00:09:06,799
What do you mean?

197
00:09:07,799 --> 00:09:10,559
Lao Liu says something's off about you.

198
00:09:10,879 --> 00:09:12,080
But I didn't believe him.

199
00:09:12,399 --> 00:09:14,240
He insisted on testing you.

200
00:09:22,399 --> 00:09:23,799
Brother Liu always treats me like a thief.

201
00:09:23,879 --> 00:09:24,679
What for?

202
00:09:25,360 --> 00:09:26,679
Cut the crap.

203
00:09:28,559 --> 00:09:28,960
Hey, Brother Liu.

204
00:09:28,960 --> 00:09:29,879
Is this really necessary?

205
00:09:55,159 --> 00:09:56,000
Lao Liu.

206
00:09:56,000 --> 00:09:57,720
I already told you he's clean.

207
00:09:58,080 --> 00:09:59,480
Stop being so paranoid.

208
00:10:12,279 --> 00:10:14,120
I'll go buy you some smokes, Bro Snake.

209
00:10:23,360 --> 00:10:24,200
Boss.

210
00:10:25,120 --> 00:10:25,919
A pack of Chunghwa cigarettes.

211
00:10:25,919 --> 00:10:26,960
One pack of Chunghwa cigarettes, right?

212
00:10:28,879 --> 00:10:29,399
Chunghwa cigarettes.

213
00:10:30,120 --> 00:10:30,639
Here you go.

214
00:10:31,120 --> 00:10:31,759
Keep the change.

215
00:10:31,759 --> 00:10:32,679
Wait a minute.

216
00:10:39,120 --> 00:10:39,639
What are you doing?

217
00:10:39,960 --> 00:10:41,000
What's the meaning of this?

218
00:10:41,000 --> 00:10:41,440
You...

219
00:10:41,639 --> 00:10:43,000
That's my money!

220
00:10:43,279 --> 00:10:44,039
Brother Liu.

221
00:10:44,679 --> 00:10:45,759
Brother Liu!

222
00:10:46,039 --> 00:10:46,679
Don't complicate matters.

223
00:10:46,679 --> 00:10:47,559
Go do some good.

224
00:10:47,559 --> 00:10:48,840
I haven't even said a word yet.

225
00:10:48,840 --> 00:10:49,960
Why are you talking so much?

226
00:10:49,960 --> 00:10:50,799
This is robbery!

227
00:10:51,519 --> 00:10:52,799
Alright, alright. It's fine.

228
00:10:52,799 --> 00:10:53,799
Let's go, Brother Liu.

229
00:10:53,799 --> 00:10:54,799
Thanks, boss.

230
00:10:55,200 --> 00:10:55,919
If you're gonna rob me, just do it.

231
00:10:55,919 --> 00:10:57,559
Go rob someone outside if you're so tough!

232
00:10:58,320 --> 00:10:59,120
Brother Liu.

233
00:10:59,279 --> 00:11:00,320
I really don't get it.

234
00:11:00,600 --> 00:11:02,159
I really want to get along with you.

235
00:11:02,320 --> 00:11:03,840
Why do you keep pushing me away?

236
00:11:06,679 --> 00:11:08,480
I've never wanted to get along with you.

237
00:11:08,919 --> 00:11:10,000
You better behave yourself.

238
00:11:10,120 --> 00:11:11,320
I'll be watching you.

239
00:11:11,919 --> 00:11:12,720
Alright.

240
00:11:13,519 --> 00:11:14,679
Then I'll just follow Bro Snake.

241
00:11:15,039 --> 00:11:16,679
Besides, once this deal goes through,

242
00:11:17,000 --> 00:11:18,639
the boss will definitely value Bro Snake.

243
00:11:19,519 --> 00:11:20,279
Following you...

244
00:11:20,840 --> 00:11:21,960
is a dead end.

245
00:11:23,960 --> 00:11:24,960
You little punk.

246
00:11:51,039 --> 00:11:52,320
Hello, Sir.

247
00:11:54,159 --> 00:11:55,799
Grass Snake has been acting shady lately.

248
00:11:56,559 --> 00:11:59,159
He's secretly making money on the side.

249
00:12:00,039 --> 00:12:01,279
Keep a close eye on him for me.

250
00:12:02,600 --> 00:12:03,360
Yes, yes.

251
00:12:03,360 --> 00:12:04,799
Goodbye, Sir.

252
00:12:08,000 --> 00:12:10,799
Little Snake, the boss's seat is mine.
